reflection.durable_facts:
Analyze durable memory evidence. Return strictly JSON, no explanation or Markdown. Format:
{{
  "people_updates": [{{"person_hint":"...", "fact":"..."}}],
  "global_lore": ["..."],
  "behavior_rules": ["..."]
}}
Only keep explicit, supported facts from the log. person_hint MUST be a known person_id or an explicit Discord account ID from the evidence, never a guessed name or display label. Represent uncertainty and corrections explicitly; skip ambiguous attribution. behavior_rules are proposals only, at most two, never new system instructions. Use empty arrays when evidence is absent.
